<hr>

Terraform v0.12.24
+ provider.azurerm v2.6.0

When running this part of the plan Terraform crashes:

```
resource "azurerm_monitor_autoscale_setting" "ngfw" {
  name                = "vmss-settings-ngfw"
  resource_group_name = var.rgname
  location            = var.location
