### Description

The azurerm_key_vault_certificate resource lacks the option to create self-signed CA certificates. Please add the possibility to define the x509v3 basic constraint ca:true and/or pathlen:<some integer>

The Azure Portal UI, as well as az-cli, lacks this feature. However, the Key Vault REST API supports it. Please see the reference to the existing documentation bug.

### New or Affected Resource(s)

<!--- Please list the new or affected resources and data sources. --->

* azurerm_key_vault_certificate

### Potential Terraform Configuration

<!--- Information about code formatting: https://help.github.com/articles/basic-writing-and-formatting-syntax/#quoting-code --->

```hcl
resource "azurerm_key_vault_certificate" "example" {
  name         = "generated-cert"
  key_vault_id = azurerm_key_vault.example.id

  certificate_policy {
    issuer_parameters {
      name = "Self"
    }

    key_properties {
      exportable = true
      key_size   = 2048
      key_type   = "RSA"
      reuse_key  = true
    }

    lifetime_action {
      action {
        action_type = "AutoRenew"
      }

      trigger {
        days_before_expiry = 30
      }
    }

    secret_properties {
      content_type = "application/x-pkcs12"
    }

    x509_certificate_properties {
      key_usage = [
        "cRLSign",
        "digitalSignature",
        "keyCertSign",
        "keyEncipherment",
      ]

      basic_constraints {
        ca = true
        path_len_constraint = 2
      }

      subject            = "CN=hello-world"
      validity_in_months = 12
    }
  }
}
```

### References

The key vault rest api for creating certificates supports basic constraints. However, this is undocumented and addressed: [azure-rest-api-specs #8295](https://github.com/Azure/azure-rest-api-specs/issues/8295)

I verified, that the following REST call, will generate a certificate with the requested basic_constraints:
```
POST https://<vault-name>.vault.azure.net/certificates/<cert-name>/create?api-version=7.1
Authorization: Bearer <token>
content-type: application/json

{
  "policy": {
    "key_props": {
      "exportable": true,
      "kty": "RSA",
      "key_size": 2048,
      "reuse_key": false
    },
    "secret_props": {
      "contentType": "application/x-pkcs12"
    },
    "x509_props": {
      "subject": "CN=somesubject.com",
      "sans": {
        "dns_names": [
          "somesubject.com"
        ]
      },
      "key_usage": [
        "cRLSign",
        "digitalSignature",
        "keyCertSign",
        "keyEncipherment"
      ],
      "basic_constraints": {
        "ca": true,
        "path_len_constraint": 3
      }
    },
    "issuer": {
      "name": "Self"
    }
  }
}
```

