* Please do not leave "+1" or "me too" comments, they generate extra noise for issue followers and do not help prioritize the request
* If you are interested in working on this issue or have submitted a pull request, please leave a comment

### Description

Currently `certificate_policy` is a required block, while it should be optional, at least when importing a certificate. The information needed to fill in the block can be determined from the certificate itself or is otherwise automatically filled in by Azure.

### New or Affected Resource(s)

* azurerm_key_vault_certificate

### Potential Terraform Configuration

I've modified the existing example from the documentation to only include what is actually required:

```hcl
resource "azurerm_key_vault_certificate" "test" {
  name      = "imported-cert"
  vault_uri = "${azurerm_key_vault.test.vault_uri}"

  certificate {
    contents = "${base64encode(file("certificate-to-import.pfx"))}"
  }
}
```

### References

The [REST API documentation](https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/rest/api/keyvault/importcertificate/importcertificate) shows that the `policy` block is not required.

When importing a certificate through the Azure Portal, the certificate name and certificate file are required, and the certificate password is optional. You can use your browser's developer tools to inspect the POST request, the only thing posted in addition to the user-provided information is an `enabled` attribute:

```
https://vault-name.vault.azure.net/certificates/certificate-name/import?api-version=2016-10-01
{"value":"...","pwd":"...","attributes":{"enabled":true}}
```

You can then retrieve the certificate using the Azure CLI and you'll see that a complete `policy` block has automatically been created:

```
$ az keyvault certificate show --id "https://vault-name.vault.azure.net/certificates/certificate-name"

{
  ...
  "policy": {
    ...
    "issuerParameters": {
      "certificateTransparency": null,
      "certificateType": null,
      "name": "Unknown"
    },
    "keyProperties": {
      "curve": null,
      "exportable": true,
      "keySize": 2048,
      "keyType": "RSA",
      "reuseKey": false
    },
    "lifetimeActions": [
      {
        "action": {
          "actionType": "EmailContacts"
        },
        "trigger": {
          "daysBeforeExpiry": null,
          "lifetimePercentage": 80
        }
      }
    ],
    "secretProperties": {
      "contentType": "application/x-pkcs12"
    },
    "x509CertificateProperties": {
      ...
    }
  }
  ...
}
```

