Add Support for forceUpdateTag in azurerm_virtual_machine_extension

Since terraform allows users to dynamically change their infrastructure, it would be good if it can take advantage of the `forceUpdateTag` that Azure provides so that operators/administrators can run the azurerm_virtual_machine_extension at anytime, not just for the initial deployment of the virtual machine. 

More information on this API endpoint on Microsoft's Azure page [here](https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/rest/api/compute/extensions/extensions-add-or-update). 
